      "title": "Govt to set up high-level banking committee soon: Nirmala Sitharaman",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/finance/news/govt-to-set-up-high-level-banking-committee-very-soon-126081700501_1.html",
      "description": "Finance Minister Nirmala Sitharaman said the two-day PSB Confluence deliberations will provide substantive material for the high-powered panel on banking for Viksit Bharat",
