    {
      "title": "Govt to soon constitute panel on 'Banking for Viksit Bharat': Sitharaman",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/finance/news/govt-to-soon-constitute-panel-on-banking-for-viksit-bharat-sitharaman-126081700473_1.html",
      "description": "Finance Minister Nirmala Sitharaman on Monday said the government would soon constitute a high-level panel on 'Banking for Viksit Bharat'.\nIn this year's Budget, the Finance Minister had proposed a high-level committee on 'Banking for Viksit Bharat', to comprehensively review the sector and align it with India's next phase of growth.\nAddressing the two-day PSB Confluence here, Sitharaman said, \"We expect the announcement of the high-powered committee to look into the banking sector... soon the committee will be announced.\"\nShe said the committee would give its thoughts and recommendations to the government.\n\"I propose setting up a 'High Level Committee on Banking for Viksit Bharat' to comprehensively review the sector and align it with India's next phase of growth, while safeguarding financial stability, inclusion and consumer protection,\" she had said in the Budget speech on February 1, 2026.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-08-17T07:15:11"
    }
  ]
